Splunk Spec Files: notice

The .conf, .conf.spec and splunkrc_cmds.xml files in this repository are not
the work of this repository's maintainers. They come from Splunk Enterprise
installation packages.

Since version 10.6.1.1, each version is copied unmodified by the Update Splunk
Spec Files workflow (.github/workflows/update-splunk-specs.yml) from the
package for Linux (amd64) published at download.splunk.com:

  etc/system/default/*.conf          -> *.conf
  etc/system/README/*.spec           -> *.conf.spec
  etc/system/static/splunkrc_cmds.xml -> splunkrc_cmds.xml

Earlier versions were committed by hand, much of that history in the upstream
repository jewnix/splunk-spec-files, which this repository continues. The
README's "Known gaps" section lists the files that were not refreshed for a
run of releases.

